A||||1||WKDFIRO||Fiero Motorsports to close its doors in June||||9||
Z||000000||WKDFIRO||04-26-2000||04:36 AM||||The "Fiero Doc" will be seeing his last patient in June. After working on Fieros exclusively for the last 14 years Keith Huff has decided to retire for a well deserved vacation. He will not be leaving the world of Fieros all together but is looking forward to finally completeing his Northstar and putting it into his impressive Orange 86 SE. Thank you all for your words of encouragement and years of Fieros. It was fun while it lasted! <BR>The final Tire Kicker of Fieros West At Fiero Motorsports will be May 6. In June we will be having the Kicker at Huntington Beach for the Concourse of HB. After which in August the Tire Kicker will resume at its new location: FOCOA headquarters in Anaheim! ||||reg||9
Z||000001||Old Lar||04-26-2000||06:32 AM||||Sorry to see Fiero Doc retire.  Just stay available to give us some advice.  Get to work on the Anaheim site.  The museum needs some work from when I was there in Feb.||||reg||1
